  (text "SAO++ power select: the switch common feeds the LEDs. Position 1 = badge 3.3 V, position 2 = OFF (pin 2 unconnected), position 3 = coin cell." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "da0b6d76-de08-563b-9933-7a8c2b73375c"))
  (text "The badge supply and the coin cell sit on separate switch contacts and are never connected to each other." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 41.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "358a10db-a29c-58d8-925a-70e17ca583c4"))
  (text "LED-only board: SDA, SCL, GPIO1 and GPIO2 are not connected, so no series diode is needed on the cell (see docs/standard.md section 3)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5d674bf3-5610-51e7-ab0a-da3b8bdb1f9c"))
  (text "D1, D2 = the two eyes. One 1.3k resistor per white LED: about 0.45 mA each on badge power, about 0.2 mA each on a fresh cell." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 147.32 99.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "411823ce-32e3-5eb3-8e94-3655d468034a"))
